{"author":{"id":"746a4d30afc20b78119cb8ed7c194f988174fc252f0e9d9eb92022244ef86db3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1777144527,"nonce":"uhOQlqfP7jvLVUCgjEMlKzAy1Kg=","metadata":{"github-id":"I_kwDOK4fCvM8AAAABAgdRrQ","github-url":"https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/92","origin":"github"},"title":"Logs convention: per-(deployment, host) files + close-out #57","message":"## Problem\n\nThe current BizzyBoat logging artifact `docs/bizzyboat_deployment_log.md` has grown to ~3500 lines covering ~5 weeks. It conflates per-session detail with longer-term umbrella-style milestones, is hard to navigate, and is hard to scope changes against. The umbrella issue [#57](https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/57) has accumulated 30+ checkboxes across 4 milestones, with no clear close path.\n\nThis issue tracks the convention restructure plus the close-out of #57.\n\n## New convention\n\n- **Per-(deployment, host) log files**: `docs/logs/\u003cyear\u003e/\u003cYYYY-MM-DD\u003e_\u003clabel\u003e_logs.md`\n  - Date = deployment **start** date (UTC); file grows over the deployment's wall-clock lifetime, including wrap-up days\n  - Label = `dev` literal in GitHub-origin clones, `hostname -s` in field-origin clones (matches `field_mode.sh --describe`)\n  - One file per deployment per agent host; deployment issue groups them\n  - Continue-vs-new is the user's call (sensible defaults: existing file in worktree on dev, recent file on field)\n- **One deployment issue per deployment** — opened at start, lists today's items + planned scope; closes when wrap-up PR merges\n- **Task issues** for specific bounded work (existing pattern; #76, #77, #87, etc.)\n- **Roadmap** (`docs/roadmap.md`) for vision / deferred / \"do this someday\" items — replaces the umbrella's milestone-checkbox role\n- **No umbrella going forward** — closed task issues + closed deployment issues + active roadmap give the same coverage without an open-forever issue\n\nFull convention written up in `docs/logs/README.md` (added in this PR).\n\n## #57 close-out\n\n### Items already tracked (no new issue needed)\n\n| #57 item | Tracked in |\n| --- | --- |\n| mercat NTP final verification | [#76](https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/76) (sonar bring-up — has NTP as a blocker) |\n| ROS coverage visualization (QINSy → ROS) | [`rolker/marine_tools#1`](https://github.com/rolker/marine_tools/issues/1) |\n| M3 sensor offsets / URDF update | [#77](https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/77) |\n| Operator logbook field test | [`rolker/rqt_operator_tools#2`](https://github.com/rolker/rqt_operator_tools/issues/2) |\n| Student-facing operating docs | [#18](https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/18) |\n| FCU battery params apply (field-gated) | [#55](https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/55) + PR [#56](https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/pull/56) |\n| WiFi range observations | memory note `project_wifi_range.md` |\n\n### Items moved to new task issues (opened with this PR)\n\n| #57 item | New issue |\n| --- | --- |\n| TF extrapolation fix on multi-line survey goals | [`rolker/unh_marine_navigation#23`](https://github.com/rolker/unh_marine_navigation/issues/23) |\n| `SeaSurfaceLayer::matchSize()` segfault fix | [`rolker/unh_marine_perception#6`](https://github.com/rolker/unh_marine_perception/issues/6) |\n| Validate OAK camera → costmap end-to-end (depends on segfault fix) | [`rolker/unh_marine_perception#7`](https://github.com/rolker/unh_marine_perception/issues/7) |\n| Pre-launch checklist | [`rolker/rqt_operator_tools#29`](https://github.com/rolker/rqt_operator_tools/issues/29) |\n\n### Items moved to roadmap (`docs/roadmap.md`, added in this PR)\n\n- Vision: fully autonomous survey round-trips\n- June 2026 hydrography class as forcing function\n- Hover v5 (range-aware taper) — v4 is sufficient\n- Hover vectored-thrust parameter\n- DNS-over-HTTPS on RUTX11\n- WiFi bridge: static routes → default gateway approach\n- Forward USB camera (black image)\n- IzzyBoat WireGuard return path fix\n- Formal WiFi range test (deferred)\n\n## What this PR does\n\n1. Add `docs/logs/README.md` (the convention spec)\n2. Add `docs/roadmap.md` (vision + deferred items, seeded from #57 body)\n3. Freeze `docs/bizzyboat_deployment_log.md` with header pointing forward — **does not migrate content**; the Apr 24 deployment continues writing into the legacy log per \"still wrapping up the Apr 24 deployment\" guidance\n4. (Already done outside this PR) Open the 4 new task issues listed above\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- [ ] This PR merges\n- [ ] Task issues created (linked above) ✅ done before PR opened\n- [ ] [#57](https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/57) closed with reference back to this issue / PR\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context)`","files":null}]}